{"server":"tw","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_03_beg","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_03","title":"臨時停車","storyCode":"RS-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"addd059f4297bedcaa7472416b1525180a0ef1207c76e842a4d5aee6e66baa03","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"narration","text":"各位乘客，本次列車到達終點站——\n銀心湖站。\n銀心湖位於盆地中央，湖面霧氣瀰漫，水質清澈，是謝拉格土地上孕育出的眾多瑰寶之一。\n傳說銀心湖是耶拉岡德落下的第一滴眼淚，在冬季，您可以於冰封的湖面上漫步，透過冰面，還可以觀賞冰層深處的風景。\n而最新建起的耶拉岡德像佇立於銀心湖的湖心島之上，耶拉岡德在此，注視著謝拉格與其子民。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"各位乘客，本次列車……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，一切都是誤會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有隱情，沒有追殺，沒有什麼可能在車上的重要人物，什麼都沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你指的是讓我登上這趟列車的“重要人物”，那就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"短短一個月就在牧民間揚名，擅長醫治馱獸的哈洛德·克雷加文子爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的榮幸，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請您原諒，鐧女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您手套上的血跡，實在令人難以不多做一些設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血跡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你很在意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼在意，告訴你也無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"洗耳恭聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉生產時的情況不是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"突然早產，出血量很大，費了我不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早產……出血量還不少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是小事，鐧女士，莉莉她現在狀況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我幫她做了緊急處理，但後續的護理還需要專業人士來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老雷昂指名說最信得過你，克雷加文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之後就要看你的本事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！我立刻就趕過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你現在的表情有點遺憾。怎麼，不符合你的想像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我不介意讓你的想像成真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就不必了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說說看，你們都誤會了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個……哈哈，銀心湖真是個不錯的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天的天氣也不錯，風和日麗，空氣清新……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……維多利亞人連轉移話題都要談論天氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種套話我聽過一萬次，膩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請您見諒，在維多利亞，我們會從小學習如何靠我們糟糕的天氣來開啟話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請您不要隨便抹黑維多利亞的形象，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼還在這站著聊天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是有點小誤會嗎，你們說開了沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是某些人危言聳聽，也不至於產生這樣的誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，你們都解決了就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然在列車上跑跑挺有趣的，但我不想再蹲在桌子底下吃灰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我剛剛去前面看了看，那邊有導遊姐姐指路，我還要了兩張地圖來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡離銀心湖就一條街的距離，很方便的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說，我們現在出發？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……我很抱歉，羅莎琳，我無法兌現之前的承諾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在有一位更加需要我的女士，我必須盡快趕到她的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……莉莉真的是馱獸吧？不是什麼，維多利亞貴族的暗語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我求您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，知道了，你還是趕快去看看那位“莉莉女士”吧，我這沒什麼，我自己一個人完全沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅莎琳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼了，幹嘛這副表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是個善解人意的好女孩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，讓我們先交換一下聯絡方式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果遇到困難，隨時可以聯絡我，哈洛德樂意為你效勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你的父親……謝拉格美男子，對吧？我也會幫你留意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就多謝了，大叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們繼續聊吧，我先走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，多好的孩子，剛剛失去母親，卻還能如此樂觀，如此堅強……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝拉格美男子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅莎琳這孩子這趟來謝拉格，就是想要找到多年未見的父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是感人，希望她能一切順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩是這麼說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然誤會已經解開，那……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧女士，我是您忠實的支持者，不知可否賞臉簽名——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先走了，你記得照顧好莉莉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，且慢，請留步，鐧女士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這就走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的黑騎士女士看起來並不喜歡那段輝煌的過往經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也難怪，她畢竟是以那樣的方式被卡西米爾驅逐……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不好意思，原來你還在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想隨意發言，惹怒那位黑騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有自知之明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發言確實應當更加謹慎，這是我的失誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，子爵閣下，您當真相信鐧女士給出的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑騎士自脫離卡西米爾，跟隨希瓦艾什前往謝拉格以來，一直都是其手下的心腹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據我所知，這位女士最近一段時間，都在某座山中，為喀蘭貿易訓練一批新式部隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而近期我們的人發現，謝拉格與外界的進出口交易頻繁，特別是在一些敏感的材料方面，交易數額都有些異常……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都還只是我的推測，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想，您應該也是有所懷疑，所以才會留下那位羅莎琳小姐的聯絡方式，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來在維多利亞的工作經歷讓你得了無法信任他人的病，我替你感到遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"職責所在，還請見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天發生的事，我會向公爵閣下如實報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容我再次提醒您，子爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請記住您身負的職責，不要辜負公爵閣下的期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這並非一場觀光之旅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於與喀蘭貿易的合作，不知泰勒先生考慮得如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰已經帶您參觀喀蘭貿易旗下的礦場與工廠，您對謝拉格與喀蘭貿易是否滿意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"對希瓦艾什先生您的公司，我當然是滿意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"只不過，希瓦艾什先生，您也是生意人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"我想您一定能理解，這樣大的案子，若是與喀蘭貿易合作，我一定不會如此猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"但要說與謝拉格官方合作……大家對謝拉格的了解也還不深，許多事情，我還是需要更加慎重地考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"前幾天，我還在街上瞧見了維多利亞的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"希瓦艾什先生，謝拉格與維多利亞……該不會鬧什麼矛盾吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以向您保證，您在謝拉格的安全不會受到任何威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以慢慢考慮，泰勒先生。謝拉格不會令您失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞富商","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":true,"text":"那是再好不過了！希望我們能合作愉快，希瓦艾什先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰，明天你繼續帶泰勒先生參觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正常範圍內的需求，都可以滿足對方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不過老爺，我們真的要跟這位泰勒先生合作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為他不是一個好的合作對象？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屬下不敢擅自評判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，這位先生在謝拉格的這段時間，一次次推脫合約簽署，在利潤分配上反口了數次，恐怕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得不錯，泰勒先生是一位精明的商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的謝拉格只能與這些嗅覺敏銳的精明商人合作，而他們，卻有不只一個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓謝拉格成為他們的唯一選項，就是今後我要做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰，你先去看看鐧的新兵隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們護衛泰勒先生出行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":true,"text":"恩希歐迪斯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得你會用通訊器，我以為你很討厭這種遠程聯絡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我只是討厭別人聯絡我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":true,"text":"恩希歐迪斯，有件事我想你該知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我在去銀心湖的列車上遇到了個羅德島來的丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你和羅德島又有什麼新合作了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g8_kjeragstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧一瞧看一看！特製謝拉格雪花乾酪，大號馱獸擺件，精美聖女畫像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格特產應有盡有了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"競爭商家","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最新馱獸盲盒發售！數量有限，歡迎選購！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，好熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看，這都賣的什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這聖女畫像畫的什麼啊，初雪怎麼被畫成這樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小姐怎麼這麼說呢，這畫像可是我們聖女大人親自過目的，有保證的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，有保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，給我來一個那個什麼雪花乾酪，這就是現在最熱門的特產？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定我小時候其實吃過呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸小妹，你也是謝拉格人啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早說嘛，那你別買那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個是賣給外國遊客的，我們不用買那個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你拿點這種碎乾酪，味道不差，吃這個就可以啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這店……這不是坑外國人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼能這麼說呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小妹，你看這雪花乾酪，看看這包裝，多好看多有品味啊，遊客買特產嘛，不就為了個精緻與格調？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是多賺點包裝費，又不是以次充好，乾酪味道一定是有保證的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有點道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就給我來點這個碎乾酪吧，順便，老闆，跟你打聽個事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們謝拉格有沒有什麼大家公認的美男子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"美男子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……雖然我是佩爾羅契家的人，但這事我可得說老實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說我們謝拉格公認的第一美男子，那應該得是恩希歐迪斯老爺吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希歐迪斯……呃，銀灰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，就是希瓦艾什家的那位當家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。對，絕對不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，再換一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那……那……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，隨口問問罷了，就當個玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問你個別的事，關於銀心湖旁邊那座山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就那邊那座，那座山有什麼說法沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！那個啊，那是弗根山啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是我們這塊有名的定情聖地，年輕小情侶啊，都喜歡往那去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小情侶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還搞了什麼宣傳語，哎喲什麼“一起看日出就能永遠在一起”囉，什麼“情定謝拉格堅如寒冰”囉，嘖嘖，超肉麻的耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好多遊客都愛往上跑，要掛什麼證明感情的金鎖……欸，對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說阿克托斯老爺挺愛上山打獵，好幾次被遊客打擾了，還很不高興呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我知道了，謝了老闆，這是乾酪的錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特產商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝惠顧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是媽媽經常提起的銀心湖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那座山，弗根山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風景確實還不錯，嗯，不過這種程度的冰湖烏薩斯也不是沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，冰層還挺厚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那個看不清臉的……就是耶拉岡德像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，好高，好大的工程，這麼大的雕像真不知道得用掉多少石頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的耶拉岡德像可沒有那麼簡單！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這人還挺懂欣賞的嘛，這裡可是觀賞耶拉岡德像最好的地點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你哪位？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我是——\n咳、咳嗯！我是誰不重要，重要的是你剛剛說的話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座耶拉岡德像才不是用普通石頭建造的，為表示對耶拉岡德的敬愛，我們用的材料可都是最高等級的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最高等級？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體是指什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀都說了最高等級，當然就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，咬到舌頭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事當然是要保密了，怎麼能輕易告訴遊客呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於材料，詳細的我不能告訴你，但總之……總之很厲害就對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛不是還差點說漏嘴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最後沒說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，你沒說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你慢慢在這欣賞，我先走了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，喂！你等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼事？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你……\n呃，對了！你是遊客吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩天後的早晨，就在這裡，會舉辦耶拉岡德像的落成儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那時候你還在謝拉格，一定要記得來觀禮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼這麼自說自話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩天後的事情還說不定呢，現在看看不也一樣嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼能一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是聖女大人會親自出席主持的儀式，搞不好真能看到耶拉岡德顯靈呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……對了，你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅莎琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全名。"},{"type":"narration","text":"這麼麻煩……\n（烏薩斯語）羅莎琳·塔季揚諾夫娜·拉里娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，羅莎琳！我邀請你！這樣可以了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我休露絲·布朗陶正式邀請你，羅莎琳·塔季揚諾夫娜·拉里娜！參加兩天後的耶拉岡德像落成典禮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候你就會知道，這座耶拉岡德像是最特別的，和其他的都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼有自信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那我就拭目以待了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，等等，我還沒給你邀請函欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙……跑這麼快幹嘛啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休露絲，布朗陶家家主的妹妹，近年來作為使節頻繁代表謝拉格出使他國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，羅莎琳是她從中安排的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該想辦法竊聽的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你已經拿著你的破報紙在我的攤位面前站了五分鐘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是不買東西的話能不能借過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，抱歉，請給我來一杯馱獸奶茶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣應該就算完成菈塔托絲那個臭女人的吩咐了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然要我盯著個小丫頭，還要想辦法繼續接觸對方……莫名其妙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這小丫頭，仔細一看還真是有點眼熟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露絲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤卡坦","speakerId":"avg_npc_263_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不用我幫忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤卡坦"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情交給我，你還有什麼不放心的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休露絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_262_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們回去，我可要好好問問菈塔托絲，這個叫羅莎琳的小丫頭到底是什麼來頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
